<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Total, Hydro cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Total, Hydro cut.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total and Norsk Hydro were cut to &quot;short-term negative&quot; at Salomon Brothers, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Salomon said falling oil prices would cause near-term underperformance across the sector and noted that it had no short-term positive view on any European oil shares.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
